The Dream Demon, lost in nightmares, pushes its fantasies to the extreme, making its nightmare creations highly oppressive.

[Obsession Blessing]: The life force of summoned Nightmare Butterflies is significantly increased, making them difficult to defeat quickly;

[Rippling Surge]: The nightmare ripples overflowing from the nightmare rift spread rapidly, quickly eroding the already limited survival space.

(The beginning seems to have been torn off)

Punishment Decision:

1. Starting today, the three of you must gather under the Linglong Tower at sunrise every day for three months of tower repair work;

2. <69D0FF>Du Sichi</> must screen and prune the poisonous weeds in the canyon and is forbidden from brewing the 'goose feather-shedding' potion again;
(Goose note: or any other equivalent potion)

3. <69D0FF>Gong Weicheng</> must personally reassemble all damaged mechanisms and copy the 'Mechanical Safety Regulations' one hundred times under the supervision of the Competition Goose;
(Goose note: The supervisor has the right to increase the number of punishments based on the number of typos)

4. <69D0FF>Lu Youjie</> must strengthen his mental training during the repair of the Linglong Tower and must answer at least ten disciplinary questions correctly from the Competition Goose every day.
(Goose note: Muscles and wisdom, one of them has to be on the right track)

(The end seems to have been torn off)
